-- 4.2.3, second and third sentences: where UIC has no power to verify something in the file,
-- the file counts as complete and valid once the competent authority has officially
-- concluded. If 90 days after UIC's written request the authority has not concluded, UIC
-- must verify on its own and consider settling "on the documents and evidence collected" —
-- with no time given for doing so (finding V8).
