-- 5.2.4.1: on a fall in risk the policyholder may ask for a lower premium; UIC must answer in
-- writing within 5 days of the written request; if UIC refuses, the policyholder may
-- unilaterally "suspend performance" ("đình chỉ thực hiện") of the contract, notifying UIC at
-- once in writing. What a suspension does to cover and premium the document does not say
-- (finding V16).
